{"book":10,"chapter":51,"rubric":"LEARNING RUST / CHAT: AXUM, SQLX, TOKIO / CHAPTER 51","slides":[{"title":"From code to service","sub":"Chapter 51 · Operations","short":"Introduction","main":"Working code is not yet a service: you need configuration, logs, graceful shutdown, tests and packaging.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Works","Service","What we add"],"captions":["The code works on the developer's machine, but that is not yet a service","A service can be left overnight: configured, observable, stops and recovers cleanly","Config, logs, health, shutdown, limits, tests, packaging"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"cargo run ✓","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":156.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":214.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":290.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"\"and in prod?\"","tone":"yellow","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":40.0,"w":90.0,"h":24.0,"text":"configured","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":40.0,"w":90.0,"h":24.0,"text":"visible","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":290.0,"y":40.0,"w":90.0,"h":24.0,"text":"shuts down","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":125.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"survives failures","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"e~cell","x":245.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"tested","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":60.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":28.0,"text":"config","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":150.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":28.0,"text":"logs","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":240.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":28.0,"text":"stop","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":330.0,"y":70.0,"w":56.0,"h":28.0,"text":"docker","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[13.0,26.0]}]},{"title":"Project structure","sub":"lib and bin","short":"Structure","main":"A library with the logic and a thin main; modules by meaning; tests alongside and in tests/.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["lib + bin","Modules","tests/"],"captions":["Logic lives in the library; main is thin: config → build → run","config, db, users, rooms, messages, ws, errors: by meaning, not by type","Integration tests see the public interface and call the same app builder"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["src/lib.rs      // build_app(config) -> Router","src/main.rs     // reads config, serve(build_app(..))"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"rust","size":9.5,"lh":36.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["src/config.rs  db.rs  errors.rs  state.rs","src/users/  rooms/  messages/  ws/"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"rust","size":10.0,"lh":36.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["tests/chat.rs:","    let app = chat::build_app(test_config()).await;","    app.oneshot(request).await"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[12.8,25.6]}]},{"title":"Configuration","sub":"Fail fast","short":"Configuration","main":"Config is read from the environment and fully validated at startup; secrets are never printed.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Fail fast","Priority","Secrets"],"captions":["Read and validate everything at startup, collect ALL errors into one list","Arguments > environment > file > defaults","Debug hides the password; log connection strings without it"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["DATABASE_URL: is required","PORT: must be a port (1-65535)","MAX_CONNECTIONS: must be <= 100","→ exit(1)"],"hl":[0,1,2,3],"bad":[0,1,2],"lang":"rust","size":9.5,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":40.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"arguments","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":40.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"environment","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":290.0,"y":40.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"file","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":180.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"defaults","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":120.0,"y1":40.0,"x2":130.0,"y2":40.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":230.0,"y1":40.0,"x2":240.0,"y2":40.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["postgres://app:***@db:5432/chat","Config { db_password: \"***\", port: 8080 }"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"rust","size":9.5,"lh":36.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[13.1,26.3]}]},{"title":"Logs","sub":"tracing","short":"Logs","main":"tracing: events with levels and fields, a span per request; structured fields instead of glued text.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Levels and fields","Request span","Filter"],"captions":["Not a glued string but an event with key-value fields: searchable and aggregatable","The span carries request_id, path, user on every record inside","info by default, noisy libraries at warn; stdout, the rest is infrastructure"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["tracing::info!(room = 3, user = %name, \"message\");","// level=INFO room=3 user=anna msg=\"message\""],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"rust","size":8.5,"lh":36.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["let span = tracing::info_span!(\"req\", id = %id, path = %path);","async { handle(req).await }.instrument(span).await","// every record inside: id=… path=…"],"hl":[0,1,2],"lang":"rust","size":8.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["RUST_LOG=info,sqlx=warn,axum=debug","-- stdout → log collector → search"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":9.5,"lh":36.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[13.0,26.0]}]},{"title":"Health","sub":"health and ready","short":"Health","main":"/health: the process is alive; /ready: ready for traffic, database reachable, migrations applied.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["/health","/ready","Metrics"],"captions":["Alive: instant reply, no external dependencies","Ready for traffic: database up, migrations applied, otherwise 503","Counters by path and code in a text format for monitoring"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"GET /health","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":156.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":214.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":290.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"200 ok (instantly)","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"GET /ready","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":156.0,"y1":50.0,"x2":214.0,"y2":50.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":290.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"SELECT 1","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":90.0,"y":105.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"database down","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":156.0,"y1":105.0,"x2":214.0,"y2":105.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":290.0,"y":105.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"503","tone":"yellow","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["http_requests_total{path=\"/rooms\",code=\"200\"} 41","http_requests_total{path=\"/rooms\",code=\"404\"} 3","db_pool_connections 4"],"hl":[0,1,2],"lang":"rust","size":8.5,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[11.6,23.2]}]},{"title":"Shutdown","sub":"Graceful shutdown","short":"Shutdown","main":"On SIGTERM: stop accepting, wait for current requests, close the pool; all within a bounded time.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Order","serve","Time limit"],"captions":["Stop accepting → wait for current → close sockets → close pool → exit","with_graceful_shutdown takes a future that completes on a signal","Out of time: forced exit with a log entry"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":44.0,"y":70.0,"w":64.0,"h":30.0,"text":"stop\naccepting","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":116.0,"y":70.0,"w":64.0,"h":30.0,"text":"wait for\nrequests","tone":"blue","size":8.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":188.0,"y":70.0,"w":64.0,"h":30.0,"text":"close\nsockets","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":260.0,"y":70.0,"w":64.0,"h":30.0,"text":"close\npool","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"e","x":328.0,"y":70.0,"w":36.0,"h":30.0,"text":"exit","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["axum::serve(listener, app)","    .with_graceful_shutdown(async { rx.await.ok(); })","    .await?;","pool.close().await;"],"hl":[1,3],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":24.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"30 seconds to exit","tone":"yellow","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e~line","x1":156.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":214.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":290.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"kill + warn in log","tone":"red","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[12.0,24.0]}]},{"title":"Failures and overload","sub":"Timeouts and limits","short":"Failures","main":"Timeouts on everything, concurrency limits, clear codes when the pool or a long request runs out.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Timeouts everywhere","Limits","Retry and breaker"],"captions":["statement_timeout in the database, pool acquire_timeout → 503, overall request timeout as a layer","Concurrency limit: overload means a fast rejection, not growing queues","Retry only safe operations, with growing pauses; the breaker stops knocking on a dead service"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":40.0,"w":110.0,"h":24.0,"text":"statement_timeout","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":70.0,"y":80.0,"w":110.0,"h":24.0,"text":"acquire_timeout","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":70.0,"y":120.0,"w":110.0,"h":24.0,"text":"TimeoutLayer","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n1","x":250.0,"y":40.0,"text":"→ 504","tone":"muted","size":9.0},{"t":"text","id":"n2","x":250.0,"y":80.0,"text":"→ 503","tone":"muted","size":9.0},{"t":"text","id":"n3","x":250.0,"y":120.0,"text":"→ 408","tone":"muted","size":9.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"requests","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":120.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":156.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":210.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"limit = 100","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":262.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":290.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":330.0,"y":70.0,"w":56.0,"h":28.0,"text":"429/503","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":60.0,"y":70.0,"w":60.0,"h":26.0,"text":"closed","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":90.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":118.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":160.0,"y":70.0,"w":70.0,"h":26.0,"text":"open","tone":"red","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":195.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":238.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":290.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":26.0,"text":"probe","tone":"yellow","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[12.4,24.9]}]},{"title":"Panics","sub":"Code reliability","short":"Panics","main":"A panic in a handler must not take the service down: catch it in a layer and reply 500; but do not panic for errors.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Error ≠ panic","Catching layer","Poisoned Mutex"],"captions":["Expected failures are Result; a panic is a bug","The layer catches the panic in the handler future: a log with request_id and a 500 reply","A panic under std::Mutex poisons it: do not panic under a lock, or handle it deliberately"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"no such thing → Err","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":110.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"unwrap() on None","tone":"red","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":280.0,"y":85.0,"text":"a bug, not\nhandling","tone":"muted","size":9.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["let res = AssertUnwindSafe(next.run(req)).catch_unwind().await;","match res { Ok(r) => r, Err(_) => 500 }"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"rust","size":8.0,"lh":36.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["let g = m.lock().unwrap_or_else(|e| e.into_inner());","// PoisonError::into_inner: data is accessible"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":36.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[13.1,26.1]}]},{"title":"Tests","sub":"Levels of checking","short":"Tests","main":"Unit tests for logic, integration tests via oneshot with a real database, a few end-to-end tests with a real server.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Three levels","Schema per test","End-to-end"],"captions":["Unit: logic; integration: oneshot with a real database; end-to-end: a real server","Each test gets its own schema: table names do not clash, tests run in parallel","Few and short; waits with timeouts; time and randomness replaced"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":180.0,"y":30.0,"w":80.0,"h":24.0,"text":"end-to-end","tone":"red","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":160.0,"h":24.0,"text":"integration","tone":"yellow","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":180.0,"y":110.0,"w":260.0,"h":24.0,"text":"unit","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["CREATE SCHEMA t_17;","SET search_path TO t_17;","-- the test's tables live only here"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"rust","size":10.0,"lh":30.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["let addr = serve(build_app(cfg)).await;","register → login → create room → post → history","WebSocket: subscribe → message → event"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"rust","size":8.5,"lh":30.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[12.3,24.6]}]},{"title":"Packaging","sub":"Docker","short":"Docker","main":"Multi-stage build, release profile, unprivileged user, HEALTHCHECK, configuration from the environment.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Two stages","Dependency cache","Running"],"captions":["Build with the compiler, then a small image with a single binary","Cargo.toml/Cargo.lock in a separate layer: dependencies are not rebuilt on every edit","Not root, HEALTHCHECK, config from the environment, secrets from a secret store"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["FROM rust:1 AS build","RUN cargo build --release","FROM debian:stable-slim","COPY --from=build /app/target/release/chat /chat"],"hl":[0,2,3],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["COPY Cargo.toml Cargo.lock ./","RUN mkdir src && echo 'fn main(){}' > src/main.rs && cargo build --release","COPY src ./src      -- changes often, the layer above is cached"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"rust","size":7.5,"lh":30.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["USER app","HEALTHCHECK CMD [\"/chat\", \"--health\"]","ENV DATABASE_URL= PORT=8080","CMD [\"/chat\"]"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"rust","size":9.5,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[12.9,25.9]}]},{"title":"Operations","sub":"Zero-downtime migrations","short":"Operations","main":"The schema changes in two steps: expand, then contract; old and new code use one database at the same time.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Expand","Contract","Backups"],"captions":["Compatible first: optional column, new table, non-blocking index","Then migrate and switch, and only afterwards remove the old","A backup you never tried to restore is only hope"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":40.0,"w":140.0,"h":24.0,"text":"ADD COLUMN x NULL ✓","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":80.0,"w":140.0,"h":24.0,"text":"CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY ✓","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":90.0,"y":120.0,"w":140.0,"h":24.0,"text":"DROP COLUMN ✗ (immediately)","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":290.0,"y":80.0,"text":"old and new\ncode together","tone":"muted","size":9.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":50.0,"y":70.0,"w":70.0,"h":28.0,"text":"expand","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":88.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":106.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":140.0,"y":70.0,"w":62.0,"h":28.0,"text":"migrate","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":174.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":192.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":232.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":28.0,"text":"switch","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e3","x1":272.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":290.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":326.0,"y":70.0,"w":56.0,"h":28.0,"text":"contract","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"pg_dump → file","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":156.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":214.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":290.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"restore in sandbox ✓","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[13.8,27.6]}]},{"title":"What next","sub":"Where to grow","short":"Next","main":"Next: OpenAPI, load tests, tracing, cache and queues, horizontal scaling.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Interface","Load and tracing","Scale"],"captions":["OpenAPI description and generated